\paragraph{Datasets.}
Our analysis involves training language models on the Arxiv and Books3 datasets, which are frequently used benchmarks for evaluating model performance \cite{press2021train,chi2022kerple,li2023functional,ding2024longrope}. Also, we train the model on the large-scale dataset FinWeb-Edu \cite{lozhkov2024fineweb-edu}.
