\paragraph{Experiment settings.}
Initially, we compare \methodShortName with other baselines at training lengths 512, and 1024, with model size 125M decoder-only Transformers \cite{brown2020language}, whose configuration is shown in Appendix \ref{model configuration details}. Subsequently, we evaluate the performance of larger model sizes with 350M and 2.7 B. We also train on large-scale datasets and evaluate downstream tasks.
