\begin{itemize}[leftmargin=2em]
\item Consistent Improvement over previous work. In every benchmark, both of our enhanced pipelines outperform HLSPilot, demonstrating that the combination of large‐model code generators with MCTS exploration yields more hardware‐efficient HLS designs.

