In this experiment, to keep the discussion easy to understand, we use the entire dataset as our training set and simply use the training error to define our utility function.  Figure~\ref{fig:linregcoefall} shows the coefficients of the attributes in the linear regression on all attributes. We sort all attributes in the coefficient descending order in the figure.

