\subsection{SMART: Ability Alignment in Response Simulation via Preference Optimization}

%Goal is to fit simulated student output distribution to ground-truth IRT parameters for ability-following and item difficulty calibration. Use DPO to achieve this.

We now motivate and detail SMART, our novel method aligning simulated student responses with their given ability and the expected difficulty of the given item.
