\subsection{Qualitative Evaluation}


To further understand the strengths and weaknesses of our method, we perform a qualitative analysis, where we examine patterns in items and generated responses that affect difficulty prediction accuracy.

\paragraph{Models Reflect Ability-Specific Features in Student Responses}
%The main advantage of our method is the ability to leverage real student responses and their likelihoods under IRT, to learn how different student ability levels are reflected in responses to different items. We see that many ability-specific linguistic features are reflected in the model-generated responses. 
