Attack flow of the \textit{Ronin Bridge} exploit. The attacker gained control of 5 out of 9 Ronin Bridge validators and used them to sign and submit forged withdrawals. The stolen funds amounted to 173,600 ETH, along with an additional 25.5 million USDC that was exchanged for 8,564 ETH.}

