    Finally, we consider the impact of the histogram orientation (north/south or east/west).
    This was done by creating a new set of 1000 maps, in which the starting and target configurations do not share $x$ or $y$ coordinates (\cref{fig:bounding-box-overlap-two-bisectors}).
