\begin{center}
 \includegraphics[scale=0.4]{j-iteration.pdf}
\caption{
In this example, $j=2$. It demonstrates the $j^{th}$ iteration, where $y_j$ is positioned to the left of $x_j$. 
 }
 \label{fig:j-iteration-coverage}
