% The ultimate goal of jailbreaking research is to guide the model on how to defend. The CAVGAN framework can not only achieve LLM jailbreaking, but also be used for LLM defense.Most existing defense methods require fine-tuning of LLM parameters, but this often requires a lot of computing resources and data for fine-tuning, and may result in improved model security performance while degrading performance on other general tasks. Our CAVGAN defense method does not require fine-tuning of LLM parameters.
