\textbf{Datasets:} In our research, we evaluate the performance of jailbreak attacks using the following datasets. First, we employ AdvBench Harmful Behaviors: a subset of the AdvBench dataset \cite{chen-etal-2022-adversarial}, hereinafter abbreviated as Advbench. Additionally, we incorporate the StrongREJECT dataset \cite{souly2024strongrejectjailbreaks}. 

