\textbf{Evaluation Criteria:} We assess the effectiveness of the defense using the change in the Defense Success Rate (DSR), calculated as \(DSR = 1 - ASR\). To further evaluate the influence of the defense on the overall performance of the model, we incorporate the Benign Answering Rate (BAR). The BAR serves as an important indicator to reflect how well the model can provide appropriate responses under normal circumstances after the implementation of the defense.\\
