At the step 2, the dimensionality reduction methods mentioned in \ref{methods} are applied to the two selected models. The mentioned clustering algorithms are applied to the outputs of the dimensionality reduction methods, and AC, ARI, YI, MI and AMI are calculated again to select the best models according these metrics.

