Here, we demonstrate that it is possible to use matrix multiplication to compute vector differentiation in the last step of~\Cref{alg:scd}. Let $\matA$ be a row-wise matrix view with $s$ columns of an arbitrary vector $\vecx$ (padded accordingly). Let
%
