\subsubsection{Reconstructive results}
%===================================================================================

The meshless model-reduction method proposed is first tested on reconstructing training data for $Re=100$. Figure \ref{fig:TGV_FOM_results} presents snapshots of the FOM velocity field and pressure field at $t=0.5$ s. 
