\item The proposed model enhances data management by minimizing memory usage, increasing computational speed, and reducing storage requirements. It achieves this by generating identical feature entries for binaries that display similar behaviors by concentrating on regions of potential maliciousness and completely preprocessed CFG. This model stands apart from other models that focus on the entire binary for feature extraction.
