$M=2000$, indicating its limited ability to mitigate inter-class interference and retain knowledge from previous tasks. These findings validate that, under the same buffer budget, a balanced sampling distribution is more effective than an imbalanced one in alleviating forgetting and improving overall model performance.


\subsection{Sensitivity Analysis of \methodname{} on Temperature and Weighted Hyperparameters}
\begin{figure*}[h]
